  "scope": "A small-data classical reconstruction under supplied Einstein constraints restores the nonlinear metric and momentum constraints while preserving the TT canonical one-form. The momentum-only packet family is isotropic; the extension supplies its missing partners. A boundary-energy derivative matches the initial metric velocity on that slice. No microscopic phase, complete quantum clock algebra, finite-time gravitational evolution, Standard Model, or TOE is proved."
